Configuration management ensures Azure resources remain consistent with approved operational standards.

Key configuration management activities include:

* Standard configuration baselines
* Version control
* Configuration validation
* Change tracking
* Drift detection
* Automated remediation

For example, administrators regularly verify that production virtual machines maintain approved firewall rules and security settings.

A real-life use case is organizations preventing unauthorized configuration changes from introducing security vulnerabilities.

Effective configuration management strengthens operational consistency and compliance.
